@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #41546B
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5F8FC
skinparam classBorderColor #59708C
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF3F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #59708C
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
hide footbox
title API 权限查询 · ddd（成功认证后的领域决策）
autonumber
participant "obj: IdentityController" as C
participant "service: DddIdentityService" as S
participant "«MetaClass»\n: DddBoundary" as B
participant "repository: IdentityRepositoryPort" as R
participant "«MetaClass»\n: CoursePermissionCatalog" as Catalog
participant "aggregate: IdentityAccountAggregate" as Model
activate C
C -> S: checkApiPermission(authorization, operationId)
activate S
S -> B: execute(action)
activate B
B -> S: action.get()（应用服务中的 lambda）
activate S
note over S,R
authenticatedUser 已完成 Bearer 解析、tokens.verify、
crypto.hashToken、hasActiveSession、findUserByExternalId。
失败抛 DomainException，经 DddBoundary 转换为 401。
end note
alt 操作未登记
 S -> Catalog: requirePermissionForOperation(operationId)
 activate Catalog
 autonumber stop
 Catalog --> B: DomainException (NOT_FOUND)
 deactivate Catalog
 B --> C: ApiException (404 API_OPERATION_NOT_FOUND)
else 操作已登记
 autonumber resume
 S -> Catalog: required = requirePermissionForOperation(operationId)
 activate Catalog
 deactivate Catalog
 S -> R: permissions = permissions(user.id(), COURSE_SYSTEM)
 activate R
 deactivate R
 S -> Model: new IdentityAccountAggregate(user, [], permissions)
 activate Model
 deactivate Model
 S -> Model: allowed = hasUiPermission(required)
 activate Model
 deactivate Model
 autonumber stop
 S --> B: IdentityApiPermissionCheckResult(operationId, allowed)
 B --> S: response
 S --> C: response
end
||12||
deactivate S
deactivate B
deactivate S
deactivate C
legend bottom
RepositoryPort 的运行对象是 infrastructure.persistence.gateway.JpaIdentityRepositoryAdapter，
内部直接调用 Spring Data JPA Repositories（无 DAO 层）。
静态目录负责 operationId 映射；账号模型判断是否含所需权限；ApiErrors 映射异常为 HTTP 响应。
endlegend
@enduml
